// Windows resource file for era-launcher icon
//
// Kept deliberately free of #include <windows.h> so that BOTH resource
// compilers work:
//   - rc.exe    (MSVC / Windows SDK, found via the Windows Kits bin dir)
//   - windres   (GNU, from Git for Windows or MSYS2)
// GNU windres cannot resolve the MSVC SDK headers, so an #include here made
// the windres path fail silently and the exe shipped with no icon at all.
//
// IDI_APP_ICON is 1. Reference it from Rust with MAKEINTRESOURCEW(1).
1 ICON "src/resources/era-launcher.ico"
